<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="1f6791e9">Lead discussions with stakeholders to formulate an architecture that supports the business goals of the program. Through
these workshops, the workshop facilitators address various architectural concerns such as overall integration strategy,
technology direction, enterprise alignment, reuse of existing assets, application/data integration approach,
security/messaging/middleware architecture providing the necessary context for the team to help make the right decision
that aligns with the organization’s immediate as well as long term business goals. Not only should discussions address
architectural concerns, but also focus on devising recommended and alternate solutions. Advantages and disadvantages should
be captured for recommended solutions as well as alternate solutions.</attribute>
</Element>
